            "review_title": "Review at Unique Craft Beer",
            "review_text": "Alain D\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam24 contributions\n1\nNot to be missed in Quy Nhon\nApr 2024 • Couples\nI go there every year when I travel to Quy Nhon for several years. The food is truly delicious and an impressive beer selection, from Vietnam and several European countries. On Friday evening there is an extraordinary music show. I will come back every time I visit Quy Nhon, which is a region to discover for these landscapes of rare beauty.\nShow original\nWritten April 26, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
