            "review_title": "Review at Unique Craft Beer",
            "review_text": "Moon T\nSingapore, Singapore41 contributions\n2\nWhat a delight place! Delicious food and awesome craft beers!\nJan 2024 • Family\nThe establishment offers a delightful selection of craft beers alongside delicious food. While it may be situated in a slightly secluded location, this provides the advantage of a tranquil and cozy environment, free from excessive noise. The staff, including the friendly and attentive manager, consistently deliver exceptional service. As a loyal customer, I make it a point to visit this place whenever I find myself in Quy Nhon. I would like to extend my gratitude to the team and encourage them to continue their outstanding work.\nRead more\nWritten January 17, 2024",
