            "review_text": "Tracy Lee\nHanoi, Vietnam168 contributions\n0\nFunky venue\nFeb 2021 • Couples\nSuch a cool craft beer bar, they had a huge selection to choose from. I tried the fruity IPA it was delicious. Very friendly staff too. It's funky venue with some great artwork. The food menu was plentiful too but I didn't get round to trying anything. I will definitely return here if I ever come back to Quy Nhon.\nWritten February 19, 2021",
