            "review_text": "Peter Hoang\n15 contributions\n0\nWhat a Unique little taproom\nNov 2020 • Friends\nWhat a Unique little taproom. A very nice place in Quy Nhon that serves a very good selection of craft beer (including draft beer on-tap) and great food at reasonable prices. The beer selection will satisfy a wide range of beer lovers. The setting is lovely and staff are very friendly. Highly recommended for beer enthusiasts\nFruity IPA - draft beer on-tap is a \"must try\"\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 17, 2020",
